{"ID":"20240205153843-5szukmh","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205153843-5szukmh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153843-5szukmh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206085637-cjmjn4n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611134350-xu2w9tw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624125705-drr0axk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:7,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:7\u0026#125;","title":"161苦参","type":"doc","updated":"20240813151333"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206085637-cjmjn4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206085637-cjmjn4n","updated":"20240206085640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河南、河北、山西等地。\n【性状】\t根长圆柱形，下部常分枝，长1030cm，直径l2.5cm。表面棕黄色至灰棕色，具纵皱纹及横生皮孔。栓皮薄，常破裂反卷，易剥落，露出黄色内皮。质硬，不易折断，折断面纤维性。切片厚3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6mm，切面黄白色，具放射状纹理。气微，味苦。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t清热燥湿；祛风杀虫。主湿热泻痢；肠风便血；黄疸；小便不利；水肿；带下；阴痒；疥癣；麻风；皮肤瘙痒；湿毒疮疡 。\n【炙品】\t苦参炭：取净苦参片，置炒制容器内，用武火加热，炒至表面呈焦黑色，内部焦黄色，喷洒少许清水，灭尽火星，取出，晾干。"}]},{"ID":"20240206085631-er16o8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206085631-er16o8o","updated":"20240206085631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206085631-6dkq3wd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155722-t72cxav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155722-t72cxav","updated":"20240205155722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦参"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦参-20240205155722-vomuhbg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240806165835-s3xngd9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806165835-s3xngd9","updated":"20240806165835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 410px;","style":"width: 400px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦参 (19)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦参 19-20240806165835-cg4hod0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 400px;\" parent-style=\"width: 410px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624124952-8x9wfjw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624124952-8x9wfjw","updated":"20240813151319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 436px;","style":"width: 426px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240624130037-to3u2dy.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 426px;\" parent-style=\"width: 436px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 397px;","style":"width: 387px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦参"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦参-20240806162139-cj8i1be.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 387px;\" parent-style=\"width: 397px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 440px;","style":"width: 430px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦参 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦参 1-20240806162223-rqab80q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 430px;\" parent-style=\"width: 440px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240806162353-fm9mfp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806162353-fm9mfp9","updated":"20240813151321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦参 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦参 2-20240806162353-a3jvtf4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 556px;","style":"width: 546px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦参 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦参 3-20240806162429-1fl5xnw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 546px;\" parent-style=\"width: 556px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240806162519-5hdohmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806162519-5hdohmm","updated":"20240813151322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 580px;","style":"width: 570px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦参 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦参 4-20240806162519-r40dynh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"